msgid "The :mod:`!compression` package"
msgstr "Paket :mod:`!compression`"

msgid ""
"The :mod:`!compression` package contains the canonical compression modules "
"containing interfaces to several different compression algorithms. Some of "
"these modules have historically been available as separate modules; those "
"will continue to be available under their original names for compatibility "
"reasons, and will not be removed without a deprecation cycle. The use of "
"modules in :mod:`!compression` is encouraged where practical."
msgstr ""
"Paket :mod:`!compression` berisi modul-modul kompresi kanonis yang "
"menyediakan antarmuka ke beberapa algoritma kompresi yang berbeda. Beberapa "
"modul ini secara historis tersedia sebagai modul terpisah; modul-modul "
"tersebut akan tetap tersedia dengan nama aslinya demi alasan kompatibilitas, "
"dan tidak akan dihapus tanpa melalui siklus pengusangan terlebih dahulu. "
"Penggunaan modul-modul dalam :mod:`!compression` dianjurkan jika "
"memungkinkan."

msgid ":mod:`!compression.bz2` -- Re-exports :mod:`bz2`"
msgstr ":mod:`!compression.bz2` -- Mengekspor ulang :mod:`bz2`"

msgid ":mod:`!compression.gzip` -- Re-exports :mod:`gzip`"
msgstr ":mod:`!compression.gzip` -- Mengekspor ulang :mod:`gzip`"

msgid ":mod:`!compression.lzma` -- Re-exports :mod:`lzma`"
msgstr ":mod:`!compression.lzma` -- Mengekspor ulang :mod:`lzma`"

msgid ":mod:`!compression.zlib` -- Re-exports :mod:`zlib`"
msgstr ":mod:`!compression.zlib` -- Mengekspor ulang :mod:`zlib`"

msgid ""
":mod:`compression.zstd` -- Wrapper for the Zstandard compression library"
msgstr ":mod:`compression.zstd` -- Pembungkus untuk pustaka kompresi Zstandard"
